-triggering child. For a triggering `done` child, a missing excerpt is named by
-`detail_required`; an excerpt that contradicts the completed status or recorded
-result is unreconciled even when every checkbox is closed. Cancellation does
-not require satisfied deliverable criteria or a completed current-state
-section; its exact cancellation evidence governs reconciliation. Retrieve the
-exact child only when the bounded excerpt or other evidence leaves the
-disposition ambiguous.
-
-Retrieve only:
-
