-require satisfied deliverable criteria; its separate cancellation and
-supersession evidence governs reconciliation. The orchestrator may repair only unambiguous
-bookkeeping proven by exact recorded evidence; otherwise it returns
-reconciliation to the specialist or Primary.
-
