-`in_progress` with `--no-start`, read it back, assign the same orchestrator
-exactly once, and verify exactly one new task. If a mutation fails or is
-ambiguous, read back the issue and complete task set and do not retry blindly.
-For `empty`, record that the lane has no waiting objective and stop. For
-`busy`, `unstable`, or `error`,
