+Before execution, validate the declared bound workspace or managed repository
+target with the read-only project check. Preserve the assigned scope and
+unrelated changes. On managed-repository lanes, use the verified issue-linked
+PR and exact remote head as cross-role code transport; lane enrollment does not
+authorize force-push, merge, close, default-branch mutation, tagging, release,
+publication, or deployment. Keep Linux, native macOS, and native Windows work
